{"title":"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_5\">Problem 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the sum of the digits of the largest even three digit number (in base ten representation) \nwhich is not changed when its units and hundreds digits are interchanged.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/f/7dfccc8483efa3f8c63ad09f37e7b9f6b9e0f917.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }22\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }23\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }24\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }25\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"398\" height=\"17\" />   \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solution by e_power_pi_times_i\n</p><p>Since the number doesn't change when the units and hundreds digits are switched, the number must be of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/6/4562767217eaa6e7acb7b2d04cfc167404e8a282.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$aba$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" />. We want to create the largest even <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit number, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/9/51955db01f1d3ae46f724e189a1438a0d775657e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 8$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/0/0f0e621ddfd0f3f4728f2161b52587224c273dc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 9$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />. The sum of the digits is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/5/5058085eb951f2c69af57a01c0bcfd640a868a33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8+9+8 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"161\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME\" title=\"1979 AHSME\">1979 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1979 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1979\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a hre